## WavPack reference decoder (BSD-3-Clause)

WaxFlow's codec/wavpack decoder is derived from WavPack 5.9.0:
https://github.com/dbry/WavPack
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dbry/WavPack/5.9.0/COPYING

The median-adaptive entropy decoder, decorrelation arithmetic, metadata handlers,
fixed-point exponential table and sync predicate retain this provenance. No WMA
or FFmpeg-derived tables are included in this module.

